  "packageHash": "o/4MY7zyfVXIMfEh89jNEZ9b26ClO4vd0CPtjTJwwMwUAq0vdjMP48MVRE4VBaIcyJqkOJThzVPpGMG/iVeTOg==",
  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
